    "domain": "General Security Concepts",
    "type": "multiselect",
    "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>Which of the following correctly describe the relationship between managerial controls and technical controls?</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
