    "prompt": "Select THREE infrastructure design choices that improve secure remote access for a distributed workforce.",
    "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>An organization is replacing its legacy VPN concentrator with a modern secure remote-access architecture.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
