    "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>Developers are deploying microservices on Kubernetes. The operations team must enforce least-privilege and isolation for all pods.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
