    "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>A government agency is retiring a set of firewalls and switches that processed sensitive data. The security operations team must ensure no residual configuration or data remains.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
