    "type": "multiselect",
    "prompt": "Which SIEM operational practices support effective incident investigation?",
    "scenario": "<div class=\"scenario-text\"><p>The SOC needs the SIEM to be a reliable platform for investigation, not just alerting.</p></div><div class=\"requirements-box\"><h3>Select exactly THREE</h3></div>",
